.TH GUMMI 1 "APRIL 2011" Linux "User Manuals"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
gummi \- LaTeX editor
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B gummi
is a simple LaTeX editor for GTK+.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\-d
run gummi with debug logging enabled.
.TP
\-h
display command line options.
